{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-s-polynomial","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:s-polynomial","kind":"definition","title":"$S$-polynomial","uses":["papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-admissible-system","papers/unital-groebner-bases/blocks/def-leading-term-data"],"cites":["references/leitnerpawloski2004"],"tags":["groebner-basis","s-polynomial"],"leanRef":"ugb:UGB.UnitalGroebner.sPolynomial","text":"s-polynomial.md","leanSource":"s-polynomial.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"def:s-polynomial\"></a>\n<strong>Definition.</strong> <em><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code>-polynomial</em></p>\n<p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(B, &#x3C;)</code> be as in the\n<a href=\"#def:groebner-basis\">Gröbner--Shirshov basis</a> definition.</p>\n<p>For <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">f, f' \\in A</code>, an <strong><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code>-polynomial</strong> is\nconstructible about <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">f</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">f'</code> if there exist\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">u, u', v, v' \\in B</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda, \\lambda' \\in R^*</code> such that</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\lambda\\,\\mathrm{LT}(u \\cdot \\mathrm{LT}(f) \\cdot v)\n  = \\lambda'\\,\\mathrm{LT}(u' \\cdot \\mathrm{LT}(f') \\cdot v').</code></pre>\n<p>In this case,</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  S(f, f') := \\lambda\\, u \\cdot f \\cdot v\n    - \\lambda'\\, u' \\cdot f' \\cdot v'.</code></pre>\n"}
